00:10:16.560 --> 00:10:18.960
Now that it's available for $259.99,

00:10:18.960 --> 00:10:21.300
it's gone from no-buy to no-brainer.

00:10:21.300 --> 00:10:23.850
And it's an especially good
value compared to the 4060,

00:10:23.850 --> 00:10:25.980
which is still $300 because

